            "question": "Licensed Aesthetician:",
            "answer": "<p>The Ioniderm functions as the core foundation of advanced facial treatments. By deploying its stable galvanic current via the specialized Spontex attachments, aestheticians can effortlessly liquefy impacted sebum. This professional methodology dramatically reduces the physical force needed during manual blackhead extractions, protecting the practitioner from repetitive hand fatigue while offering clients a smooth, irritation-free pore restoration process.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_74hYTC": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Clinical Spa Technician:",
            "answer": "<p>In high-volume skincare facilities, workflow continuity is vital. The Ioniderm features an immediate dual-polarity toggle system controlled via distinct color-coded lead wires (red and black). This allows technicians to switch instantly from alkaline desincrustation to acidic product infusion without changing electrodes, accelerating multi-modality treatment times and maximizing room turnover rates without losing diagnostic precision.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_bhzmwM": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Specialized Skincare Consultant:",
            "answer": "<p>For advanced consultations, the Ioniderm offers manual intensity adjustments that deliver a completely personalized client experience. The shock-absorbing grounding electrode ensures a gentle current flow. This enables consultants to target delicate facial zones safely, maximizing product absorption and yielding visible skin radiance immediately following treatment.</p>"
          }
        }
